MintCurveConvexPosition::withdrawFromLpAndRepay(uint256,uint256,uint256,bool)
├── given caller is not owner and not authorized spender
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionUnauthorized
└── given caller is owner or authorized spender
    ├── when lpToWithdraw is zero and sharesToRepay is zero
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
    ├── when lpToWithdraw is zero and minBorrowTokenOut is greater than zero
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
    ├── when lpToWithdraw is zero and claimRewards is true
    │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionInvalidInput
    ├── when lpToWithdraw is greater than zero
    │   ├── given the position has fewer staked LP than lpToWithdraw
    │   │   └── it should revert
    │   ├── when the Convex reward pool withdrawAndUnwrap returns false
    │   │   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionWithdrawalFromConvexRewardPoolFailed
    │   ├── when the borrow token received from the Curve removal is less than minBorrowTokenOut
    │   │   └── it should revert
    │   ├── when claimRewards is true
    │   │   ├── it should withdraw and unwrap lpToWithdraw of LP from Convex claiming rewards
    │   │   ├── it should remove liquidity one-sided from Curve into the borrow token
    │   │   ├── it should transfer all Convex rewards to the owner
    │   │   └── it should emit RewardClaimed for every nonzero token
    │   └── when claimRewards is false
    │       ├── it should withdraw and unwrap lpToWithdraw of LP from Convex without claiming rewards
    │       ├── it should remove liquidity one-sided from Curve into the borrow token
    │       └── it should not transfer any rewards
    ├── when sharesToRepay is greater than zero
    │   ├── given sharesToRepay exceeds the position's borrow shares
    │   │   └── it should revert
    │   ├── given the position balance plus owner funds cannot cover the required borrow token
    │   │   └── it should revert
    │   └── given enough borrow token is available
    │       ├── it should pull any borrow token shortfall from the owner
    │       ├── it should repay sharesToRepay of debt on the mint market
    │       └── it should emit Repaid
    ├── when lpToWithdraw, sharesToRepay are non-zero and claimRewards is true
    │   ├── it should unwind the LP, repay the debt and claim rewards in a single call
    │   ├── it should repay before sweeping a reward token that equals the borrow token
    │   ├── it should skip malformed extra reward metadata without blocking the unwind
    │   └── it should sweep any surplus borrow token to the owner
    └── given the flow completes
        ├── it should transfer any remaining borrow token to the owner
        └── it should emit Withdrawn
